	"system": {
		"description": "<p>Also at 2nd level, you’ve learned the importance of an exit strategy and adding injury to insult. You gain the following benefits.</p><ul><li><p>When you take the disengage action you also gain the benefits of the dash action, and vice-versa.</p></li><li><p>When you make weapon attacks against a target who failed a saving throw since the end of your last turn, you gain a 1d6 bonus to damage. This damage is of the same type your weapon normally deals.</p></li></ul>",
